                  </li>\n          \n            \n      <li class=\"c-menu-drilldown__item\">\n                  <a href=\"https://my.sciencemuseum.org.uk/account/create/brief\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Newsletter</a>\n                      </li>\n    \n          <li>\n        <div class=\"site-search-form c-search-mob\" data-drupal-selector=\"site-search-form-2\" id=\"block-sitesearchform-mobile\">\n  \n  <div class=\"c-search-mob__form\">\n    \n        \n        <form autocomplete=\"off\" block=\"block-sitesearchform-mobile\" action=\"/see-and-do/wild-asia-life-at-extremes\" method=\"post\" id=\"site-search-form-mobile\" accept-charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <div class=\"js-form-item form-item form-type-search js-form-type-search form-item-term js-form-item-term\">\n      <label for=\"edit-term-mobile\">\n    Search the site\n\n      </label>\n        <input data-drupal-selector=\"edit-term\" data-msg-maxlength=\"Search the site field has a maximum length of 128.\" type=\"search\" id=\"edit-term-mobile\" name=\"term\" value=\"\" size=\"60\" maxlength=\"128\" class=\"form-search\" />\n\n        </div>\n<input data-drupal-selector=\"form-rmpnjrtqy9xkvhtbyg8ggw0dlaspuip-7utyz61mbga\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"form_build_id\" value=\"form-rMPNJRtQy9XKVhTbYg8Ggw0dlASPuIP_7UTyz61MBgA\" />\n<input data-drupal-selector=\"edit-site-search-form-2\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"form_id\" value=\"site_search_form\" />\n<div data-drupal-selector=\"edit-actions\" class=\"form-actions js-form-wrapper form-wrapper\" id=\"edit-actions-mobile\">\n\n<button  data-drupal-selector=\"site-search-form-button\" type=\"submit\" id=\"site-search-form-button-mobile\" name=\"op\" value=\"Submit\" class=\"button js-form-submit form-submit btn btn--primary\">\n  Submit\n  <svg class=\"o-icon btn__icon\" role=\"presentation\">\n    <use xlink:href=\"#arrow-bold-right\"></use>\n  </svg>\n</button></div>\n\n</form>\n\n      </div>\n\n</div>\n\n      </li>\n        </ul>\n          </div>\n    </div>\n      \n\n  </nav>\n  </div>\n    </header>\n        <div id=\"main-wrapper\" class=\"o-main-wrapper clearfix\">\n      <div id=\"main\" class=\"clearfix\">\n        \n        <main id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n                            \n\n<div data-drupal-messages-fallback class=\"hidden\"></div>\n\n\n                              \n                      <article class=\"h-relative\">\n  \n      \n<div class=\"h-relative\">\n  <header class=\"c-banner-deep c-banner-deep--event | js-banner\">\n    \n    <div class=\"c-banner-deep__bg -has-overlay\">\n            <div class=\"c-banner-deep__img-wrapper\">\n        <div class=\"c-banner-deep__img\" style=\"background-image: url('https://www.sciencemuseum.org.uk/sites/default/files/styles/her/public/2026-02/wild-asia-4%20%281%29.jpg?h=42dd0ea9&amp;itok=lP8Y5VLp')\"></div>\n      </div>\n                  <div class=\"c-banner-deep__content | o-container\">\n        <div class=\"c-banner-deep__content__wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"c-breadcrumb  | js-breadcrumb\">\n                <span class=\"visually-hidden\">You are here:</span>\n    <ol class=\"o-list c-breadcrumb__links\">\n    \n          <li>\n                  <a href=\"/\">\n                          <svg class=\"o-icon c-breadcrumb__divider-icon\" role=\"presentation\">\n                <use xlink:href=\"#arrow-bold-right\"></use>\n              </svg>\n                        Home\n          </a>\n              </li>\n          <li>\n                  <a href=\"/see-and-do\">\n                        See and do\n          </a>\n              </li>\n        </ol>\n\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"c-banner-deep__title__wrapper\">\n\n                        <h1 class=\"visually-hidden\" ><span class=\"h-relative\">Wild Asia: Life at Extremes 3D (U)</span>\n</h1>\n\n            <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"c-banner-deep__title | o-title o-title--primary\">\n              <span  class=\"js-cascade\"><span class=\"h-relative\">Wild Asia: Life at Extremes 3D (U)</span>\n</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n                  </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n      </header>\n</div>\n  \n    <div class=\"o-main-content | js-sticky-container\">\n    <!-- Body content -->\n    <div class=\"o-body -first\">\n      <div class=\"o-container u-order\">\n        <div class=\"o-content u-order-body\">\n          <div class=\"c-wysiwyg\">\n              <div class=\"o-text-introduction\">\n                            <p>Embark on an epic journey across the wild lands of Asia, where breathtaking landscapes and extraordinary animals await around every corner.</p>\n\n      \n              </div>\n                          <p><span>Narrated by Colin Firth, this adventure begins on the snowy peaks of the Himalayas where you’ll meet snow leopards and tigers raising their little ones in ever-challenging conditions. You continue into remote forests where red pandas hide among treetops before landing in the Gobi Desert to meet the remarkable long-eared jumping Jerboa.&nbsp;</span></p><div class=\"embedded-entity\"><div>\n                  <div class=\"video-embed-field-provider-youtube video-embed-field-responsive-video\"><iframe width=\"854\" height=\"480\" frameborder=\"0\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ScWg4_mvVA0?autoplay=0&amp;start=0&amp;rel=0\"></iframe>\n</div>\n\n      \n  </div>\n</div><p><span>After exploring mountains and desert, you are plunged beneath the waves of the world’s richest coral seas of the Pacific, home to the cute-yet-deadly Sea Bunnies and sharks.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>In this stunning BBC Earth 3D documentary, you will be amazed by stories revealing and exploring the most incredible ways wildlife has been thriving in one of the world’s most extreme environments.</span></p><p><span class=\"TextRun SCXW145883483 BCX0 NormalTextRun\" lang=\"EN-GB\">As part of the Government's Great British Summer Savings scheme, our children's and family tickets are discounted this summer—so now is a great time to plan your visit.</span><span class=\"EOP Selected SCXW145883483 BCX0\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n      \n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"o-sidebar-wrapper-fixed  u-order-sidebar | js-sticky-sidebar\" data-sidebar-spacer=\"false\">\n          <div class=\"o-container\">\n            <div class=\"o-sidebar\">\n              <div>\n                <h2 class=\"visually-hidden\">Information</h2>\n                \n\n\n<div class=\"c-info-block c-info-block--primary\">\n  <ul class=\"c-info-block__list o-list\">\n        <li class=\"o-title o-title--tertiary c-info-block__title -first\">\n                  IMAX screening\n      \n    </li>\n        <li class=\"c-info-block__section\">\n      <ul class=\"o-list\">\n                  <li><span class=\"o-label\">Date:</span>             Now screening\n      </li>\n                                  <li><span class=\"o-label\">Duration:</span>              60 minutes including adverts\n      </li>\n                          <li><span class=\"o-label\">Price:</span>             Prices vary so book early for cheaper tickets this summer. Family discounts apply. Ages 3 and under go free. No booking fees apply.\n      </li>\n                          <li><span class=\"o-label\">Location:</span> IMAX: The Ronson Theatre\n      <span class=\"separator\">, </span>\n  Level 0</li>\n                <!-- Age and Height Restrictions -->\n                          <li><span class=\"o-label\">Age:</span>              Children under 12 must be accompanied by an adult\n      </li>\n                <!-- Festival \"parents\" -->\n              </ul>\n    </li>\n            <li class=\"c-info-block__section\">\n      <ul class=\"o-list\">\n                <li>\n          <a href=\"https://my.sciencemuseum.org.uk/events?view=calendar&amp;kid=839\" class=\"btn btn--primary -on-black\">\n            Book now\n            <svg class=\"o-icon btn__icon\" role=\"presentation\">\n              <use xlink:href=\"#arrow-bold-right\"></use>\n            </svg>\n          </a>\n        </li>\n                      </ul>\n    </li>\n                \n    \n  </ul>\n</div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n                    \n<div class=\"o-body\">\n  <div class=\"o-container\">\n    <div class=\"o-content\">\n      <section class=\"slice view-mode-default c-accordion clearfix | js-accordion\" >\n              \n        <h2  class=\"c-accordion__section-title\">            Ticket information\n      </h2>\n                                  <h3 class=\"c-accordion__title\">\n\t<button class=\"c-accordion__tab | js-accordion-tab\" id=\"tab-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"tab-content-1\">\n\t  <span>            SAVE 50% ON TICKETS\n      </span>\n\t  <svg class=\"c-accordion__icon\">\n\t    <use xlink:href=\"#arrow-accordion-down\"></use>\n\t  </svg>\n\t</button>\n</h3>\n\n<div class=\"c-accordion__content clearfix\" id=\"tab-content-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-1\">\n              <p>When you buy a <em>Wonderlab</em> or <em>Power Up</em> ticket for a specific date, you can get 50% off an <span class=\"mark3clwislmc\">IMAX</span> documentary showing on the same day. The discount will be applied automatically in the basket when you add <span class=\"mark3clwislmc\">IMAX</span> tickets to the same order.</p>\n      \n  \n</div>\n\n          <h3 class=\"c-accordion__title\">\n\t<button class=\"c-accordion__tab | js-accordion-tab\" id=\"tab-2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"tab-content-2\">\n\t  <span>            BOOK EARLY TO GET CHEAPER TICKET PRICES \n      </span>\n\t  <svg class=\"c-accordion__icon\">\n\t    <use xlink:href=\"#arrow-accordion-down\"></use>\n\t  </svg>\n\t</button>\n</h3>\n\n<div class=\"c-accordion__content clearfix\" id=\"tab-content-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-2\">\n              <p>As part of the Government's Great British Summer Savings scheme, our children's and family tickets for IMAX screenings are discounted this summer. Book early to get cheaper ticket prices:</p><ul><li>Save at least £1 per ticket when you book 1 – 6 days before your visit.</li><li>Save at least £2 per ticket when you book 7 – 13 days before your visit.</li><li>Save at least £3 per ticket when you book 14+ days before your visit. </li><li>Save at least an extra £1 by booking for an IMAX screening that starts between 15.15 – 18.00.</li></ul><p>Find out more in our <a class=\"Hyperlink SCXW243924447 BCX0\" href=\"https://www.sciencemuseum.org.uk/ticket-prices-faqs\" target=\"_blank\">FAQs</a>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n      \n  \n</div>\n\n          <h3 class=\"c-accordion__title\">\n\t<button class=\"c-accordion__tab | js-accordion-tab\" id=\"tab-3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"tab-content-3\">\n\t  <span>            Universal Credit tickets\n      </span>\n\t  <svg class=\"c-accordion__icon\">\n\t    <use xlink:href=\"#arrow-accordion-down\"></use>\n\t  </svg>\n\t</button>\n</h3>\n\n<div class=\"c-accordion__content clearfix\" id=\"tab-content-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-3\">\n              <ul><li>A limited number of discounted IMAX tickets are available to anyone in receipt of Universal Credit or some other benefits.</li><li>As part of the Government's Great British Summer Savings scheme, our children's Universal Credit tickets are discounted this summer at £4.30 per child.</li><li>Adult IMAX Universal Credit tickets are £5 per adult.</li><li>You can claim for up to five people per household.</li><li>Tickets are only available at least one day before your visit. If you can't find Universal Credit tickets for the date you wish to book, this date is sold out but further dates are available.</li><li>Please see <a class=\"Hyperlink SCXW68505022 BCX0\" href=\"https://www.sciencemuseum.org.uk/universal-credit-ticket-discounts\" target=\"_blank\">this page</a> for more details including which supporting documents are needed to show eligibility.</li></ul>\n      \n  \n</div>\n\n      \n                </section>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n      \n    \n  </div>\n</article>\n              \n\n<section class=\"o-section -secondary\" aria-labelledby=\"a-other-imax-screenings\">\n    <div  class=\"slice view-mode-default o-container clearfix\">\n      <div class=\"o-container__padding\">\n                  <h2 id=\"a-other-imax-screenings\" class=\"o-title o-title--section\">            Other IMAX screenings\n      </h2>\n                                      <div class=\"slice view-mode-thirds-3-column\">\n      <div class=\"js-carousel-teaser\" data-carousel-slidesPerView=\"1\"> \n  <div class=\"o-grid o-grid--3-col\">\n          <div class=\"o-grid__item\"><article class=\"c-card \">\n  <a href=\"/see-and-do/arctic-our-frozen-planet\" class=\"c-card__link\">\n        <div class=\"c-card__img\">\n      <div>\n                      <img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"teaser-11-7\" srcset=\"/sites/default/files/styles/11_7/public/2026-02/FP2-2HPHH-JustinHofman_DC28538%20%281%29.jpg?h=9dd951d5&amp;itok=f3LU4K3s 1x\" width=\"550\" height=\"350\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/11_7/public/2026-02/FP2-2HPHH-JustinHofman_DC28538%20%281%29.jpg?h=9dd951d5&amp;itok=f3LU4K3s\" alt=\"\" />\n\n\n\n      \n  </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"c-card__content\">\n    \t<h3 class=\"c-card__title o-title o-title--secondary\">\n        <span class=\"h-relative\">Arctic: Our Frozen Planet 3D (U) </span>\n\n      </h3>\n            <div class=\"c-card__info\">\n          <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Category: </span>            IMAX screening\n      \n      </div>\n            <div class=\"c-card__desc\">\n                  <span class=\"c-card__date\">            Now screening\n      </span>\n                          <p>            Join Benedict Cumberbatch as he explores the Arctic in an epic adventure across this magical realm of snow and ice.  \n      </p>\n                          <span class=\"c-card__tag\">            Book now\n      </span>\n              </div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</article>\n</div>\n          <div class=\"o-grid__item\"><article class=\"c-card \">\n  <a href=\"/see-and-do/t-rex-3d-pg\" class=\"c-card__link\">\n        <div class=\"c-card__img\">\n      <div>\n                      <img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"teaser-11-7\" srcset=\"/sites/default/files/styles/11_7/public/2024-12/Adult%20Rex%20Sunset%20Burst.jpg?h=c3d4457c&amp;itok=bA1ZUD3H 1x\" width=\"550\" height=\"350\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/11_7/public/2024-12/Adult%20Rex%20Sunset%20Burst.jpg?h=c3d4457c&amp;itok=bA1ZUD3H\" alt=\"\" />\n\n\n\n      \n  </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"c-card__content\">\n    \t<h3 class=\"c-card__title o-title o-title--secondary\">\n        <span class=\"h-relative\">T. rex 3D (PG)</span>\n\n      </h3>\n            <div class=\"c-card__info\">\n          <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Category: </span>            IMAX screening\n      \n      </div>\n            <div class=\"c-card__desc\">\n                  <span class=\"c-card__date\">            Now screening\n      </span>\n                          <p>            Witness the wonder years of the T.rex and learn how science contributed to the understanding of these legendary dinosaurs. Book early for cheaper prices. \n      </p>\n                          <span class=\"c-card__tag\">            Book now\n      </span>\n              </div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</article>\n</div>\n          <div class=\"o-grid__item\"><article class=\"c-card \">\n  <a href=\"/see-and-do/beautiful-planet-3d-u\" class=\"c-card__link\">\n        <div class=\"c-card__img\">\n      <div>\n                      <img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"teaser-11-7\" srcset=\"/sites/default/files/styles/11_7/public/2020-11/A-Beautiful-Planet.jpg?h=3cf665d7&amp;itok=GG-n01r- 1x\" width=\"550\" height=\"350\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/11_7/public/2020-11/A-Beautiful-Planet.jpg?h=3cf665d7&amp;itok=GG-n01r-\" alt=\"\" />\n\n\n\n      \n  </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"c-card__content\">\n    \t<h3 class=\"c-card__title o-title o-title--secondary\">\n        <span class=\"h-relative\">A Beautiful Planet 3D (U)</span>\n\n      </h3>\n            <div class=\"c-card__info\">\n          <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Category: </span>            IMAX screening\n      \n      </div>\n            <div class=\"c-card__desc\">\n                  <span class=\"c-card__date\">            Now showing\n      </span>\n                          <p>            Meet the crew on board the International Space Station and see stunning 3D views of Earth from space. Book early for cheaper prices. \n      </p>\n                          <span class=\"c-card__tag\">            Book now\n      </span>\n              </div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</article>\n</div>\n      </div>\n</div>\n  </div>\n\n      \n              </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n      \n\n\n        </main>\n              </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <footer>\n      <div class=\"c-back-to-top-panel | js-sticky-footer\">\n  <div class=\"o-container\">\n    <div class=\"c-back-to-top-panel__wrapper\">\n      <a href=\"#main-wrapper\" class=\"c-back-to-top-panel__link | js-back-top\">\n        <span>Back to Top</span>\n\n        <svg class=\"o-icon\" role=\"presentation\">\n          <use xlink:href=\"#arrow-bold-right\"></use>\n        </svg>\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n      <div class=\"c-footer\">\n                  <div class=\"o-container\">\n            <div class=\"c-footer__padding\">\n              <div class=\"c-footer__section c-footer__section--second clearfix\">\n                      <div class=\"c-footer__block -column\">\n      \n              <ul class=\"o-list\">\n                    <li>\n          <span>Location</span>\n                                    <ul class=\"o-list\">\n                    <li>\n          <span>Exhibition Road, South Kensington, London, SW7 2DD</span>\n                  </li>\n              <li>\n          <a href=\"http://www.discoversouthken.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Discover South Kensington</a>\n                  </li>\n            </ul>\n  \n                  </li>\n            </ul>\n  \n\n  </div><div class=\"c-footer__block -column\">\n      \n              <ul class=\"o-list\">\n                    <li>\n          <span>Opening times</span>\n                                    <ul class=\"o-list\">\n                    <li>\n          <a href=\"/visit\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/2746\">Open daily 10.00–18.00 (except for 24-26 December)</a>\n                  </li>\n            </ul>\n  \n                  </li>\n            </ul>\n  \n\n  </div><div class=\"c-footer__block -column -social\">\n      \n              <ul class=\"o-list\">\n                    <li>\n          <span>Newsletter</span>\n                                    <ul class=\"o-list\">\n                    <li>\n          <a href=\"https://my.sciencemuseum.org.uk/account/create/brief\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Sign up</a>\n                  </li>\n            </ul>\n  \n                  </li>\n              <li>\n          <span>My Account</span>\n                                    <ul class=\"o-list\">\n                    <li>\n          <a href=\"https://my.sciencemuseum.org.uk/account/login\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">My bookings</a>\n                  </li>\n              <li>\n          <a href=\"https://groups.sciencemuseum.org.uk/login\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">My school or group bookings</a>\n                  </li>\n            </ul>\n  \n                  </li>\n              <li>\n          <span>Keep in touch</span>\n                                    <ul class=\"o-list\">\n                    <li>\n          <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sciencemuseumlondon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Facebook</a>\n                  </li>\n              <li>\n          <a href=\"https://twit